Adyar I. p. 187 (25 mss.; 16 inc.; 3 with C.). Adyar D.

) quotes two of the works mentioned above, Rasamañjarī (ms. p. 116b) an. Satyāvadhūpariṇaya (ms. p. 91a) in the name of the poet-laureate of Kṛṣṇadevarāya, Allasāni Peddaṇṇa. The same compendium quotes also a. Alaṁkārasārasaṅgraha of Kṛṣṇadevarāya (ms. p. 116b). But Prapañcadarpaṇa is a thoroughly unreliable work an. is full of wrong an. fanciful citations.
The reported ms. of Uṣāpariṇayanāṭaka of Kṛṣṇadevarāya noted on p. 219 of M. Krishnamachariar's His.. of Classical Skt. Lit. is similarly a matter to be verified. [Page322-b]
